        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn WT2BI, Warwick Single Cylinder Mortise Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGraded for residential doors of average weight and size, the Warwick Single Cylinder Mortise Handleset features a s-shaped grip off set by lovely mounts that look as if they have been inspired by nature. It is perfect for restoration projects because of its old world design and material. The black iron finish is guaranteed not to rust. For doors 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick with a 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is operated by key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUnlike a simple tubular latch, this is a mortise lock. They are extremely durable and have a tighter clearance tolerance. You know it's a mortise lock when you hear that heavy, smooth, solid 'click' when the door closes shut.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the knob operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/warwick-dummy-handleset-acorn-wt2bd\"><b>Warwick Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/half-round-rough-black-iron-knob-acorn-rt8bd\"><b>Half Round Rough Black Iron Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Warwick Single Cylinder Mortise Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy gauge plated steel mortise case.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-friction brass latch bolt.</li> \r\n<li>The deadbolt is made of brass with hardened steel inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Panic Proof: Turning of inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: inside knob, rose, thumbturn, cylinder, outside handle, and all necessary mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specification</b> for the Acorn WT2BI Mortise Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Cylinder Rose Length: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Cylinder Rose Width: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rose Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rose Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise: 8” x 1-1/4”</li>\r\n<li>Case: 6” x 3-5/8” x 15/16”</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 3/4” throw</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1” throw</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8” ASA</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Hubs: 3/16” on the diamond.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C-Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n<td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the knob. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Warwick Single Cylinder Handle With Knob, Acorn WT2BI",
                "description": "Graded for residential doors of average weight and size, the Warwick Single Cylinder Mortise Handleset features a s-shaped grip off set by lovely mounts that look as if they have been inspired by nature. It is perfect for restoration projects because of its old world design and material. The black iron finish is guaranteed not to rust. For doors 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick with a 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is operated by key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior.",
                "keywords": "Acorn WT2BI, Acorn WT2BD, Warwick Single Cylinder Mortise Handlesets, Warwick Single Cylinder Handle With Knobs, colonial door hardware, restoration hardware, half round knobs, black iron handlesets, acorn Single Cylinder Handlesets, Warwick Single Cylinder Handle With Knobs, Warwick Single Cylinder Handlesets, Warwick Handlesets, Warwick Iron Handlesets, old world handlesets,"
